   "proposition": "The French states the number of missing values is shown as \"Inconnu\"; the chunk at chapters/tables_descriptive.fr.qmd:895-905 does not set `missing_text =`, so the output label is \"Unknown\".",
   "reader_consequence": "A French reader cannot match the described label to the row in the printed table beside it.",
